<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.thommy87.LinDVB</id>
  <name>LinDVB</name>
  <summary>Digital TV and radio: watch and record</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-2.0-or-later</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>LinDVB is a digital TV and radio app. It plays and records satellite, cable,
    terrestrial and internet TV and radio using the Linux DVB API and GStreamer. It has
    timeshift, timer and series recordings, a programme guide, teletext, HbbTV, several
    tuners at once including Unicable/JESS, channel search and a channel editor.</p>
  </description>
